#. intro: the Guardian
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "You have been a thorn in my side for far too long, Avatar..."
msgstr "你當我的眼中釘已經太久了，聖者……"

#. intro: the Guardian
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Your two worlds will be crushed... Britannia first, then Earth!"
msgstr "你的兩個世界都將被粉碎……先是不列顛尼亞，然後是地球！"

#. intro: the Guardian
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "I shall parade you before their conquered peoples, as the fallen idol of a pathetic ideal!"
msgstr "我要把你押到那些被征服的人民面前遊街示眾，當作一個可悲理想的殞落偶像！"

#. intro: the Guardian
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "I banish you to the world of Pagan!"
msgstr "我要把你放逐到佩根的世界！"

#. intro: the Guardian
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "No one here knows of the AVATAR!"
msgstr "這裡沒有人知道「聖者」是誰！"
